{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436420/extras/fe8bc7adf9395b8a4f61632d29608c68.avif?t=1762529851\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436420/extras_big/fe8bc7adf9395b8a4f61632d29608c68.webp?t=1762529851 width=1560 height=785 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced multiplayer game, players team up to conquer challenging levels by leveraging a variety of innovative movement mechanics. The goal is to work together, optimize routes, and execute precise maneuvers to achieve the best possible time. Strategic coordination and mastery of movement skills are essential as players compete not only against the clock but also against each other, making every run a thrilling race for supremacy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1436420?t=1762529851","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1436420?t=1762529851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436420/9e588e83c9faa1ccc3afacf59783c68fc0036687/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762529851","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436420/9e588e83c9faa1ccc3afacf59783c68fc0036687/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762529851","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":